{"id": "b3d0ea6d4d6cc0bba5c34ca5eb0fa2d0", "text": "they would also fail in dhyana  meditation and would not be able to achieve \nliberation. So, they would lose out on both.  Lord Krishna answers in verse \n6.40 stating that a seeker who has tried to perform prescribed activities, \nmeditation etc., will not experience any ill effects either in this world or \nhereafter . They will not be denied birth in human species. And t hey will \nindeed not be relegated to hell. Even limited but sincere efforts will save \nsuch seekers from downfall.", "embedding": [-0.0009783076820895076, 0.08655402809381485, -0.06761877983808517, 0.015205156989395618, -0.03516671061515808, -0.037442442029714584, 0.04324803501367569, -0.09297024458646774, -0.008536393754184246, -0.003239276586100459, 0.05234093964099884, -0.056037209928035736, 0.031884852796792984, -0.007733003236353397, 0.05942102521657944, -0.021778881549835205, 0.014619768597185612, -0.02341926470398903, 0.03145308420062065, 0.039330966770648956, -0.000590717769227922, 0.060406286269426346, 0.02976110763847828, -0.03095492534339428, -0.04891001805663109, -0.02298722229897976, 0.012040329165756702, -0.02000402845442295, 0.05140150710940361, 0.0671095922589302, -0.04117000102996826, 0.0005335029563866556, -0.11897225677967072, 0.05258750915527344, -0.07005872577428818, 0.035822708159685135, -0.03460314869880676, 0.002193218329921365, 0.01512418407946825, -0.09250104427337646, 0.021625103428959846, -0.004388090223073959, -0.08561284840106964, -0.022562263533473015, 0.03803275153040886, -0.11384990066289902, -0.1264132708311081, -0.027276448905467987, -0.03811031952500343, -0.10362270474433899, -0.023199357092380524, -0.06712836772203445, 0.004639634396880865, 0.06468429416418076, -0.0410194955766201, -0.027048124000430107, -0.09492528438568115, 0.03478465974330902, -0.0010094118770211935, 0.03979117050766945, -0.04589057341217995, 0.060632701963186264, 0.005607593804597855, -0.00539438147097826, 0.096739262342453, -0.0067247